.DS_Store
*.tgz
# The litellm dependency IS committed, on purpose. Argo CD and any other
# GitOps renderer would otherwise have to resolve an OCI dependency at render
# time — extra credentials, extra failure mode, for a 185K file. Vendoring it
# keeps `helm template` working offline. Refresh with `helm dependency update`.
!chart/cyrus/charts/*.tgz
values.local.yaml
secrets.local.yaml
